# Panenara Admin API — HTTP Client File
# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client
# Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" (Huachao Mao) di VS Code
# atau buka langsung di IntelliJ / WebStorm

@baseUrl = https://api.panenara.id/v1
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE
@superAdminId = a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890
@adminId = b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901
@sampleUserId = c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012
@sampleFarmerVerifId = e5f6a7b8-c9d0-1234-ef01-345678901234
@sampleAuctionId = f6a7b8c9-d0e1-2345-f012-456789012345
@sampleTransactionId = a7b8c9d0-e1f2-3456-0123-567890123456
@sampleComplaintId = c9d0e1f2-a3b4-5678-2345-789012345678


# =============================================================================
### Auth
# =============================================================================

### Login - Super Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bagas@panenara.id",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Login - Admin Ops
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rina@panenara.id",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Current User (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Super Admin - Dashboard
# =============================================================================

### Super Admin Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/super
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Super Admin - Admin Management
# =============================================================================

### Daftar Semua Admin (tanpa filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Daftar Admin dengan Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins?q=rina&page=1&pageSize=20&role=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Tambah Admin Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Doni Prasetyo",
  "email": "doni@panenara.id",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "access_level": "limited"
}

###

### Update Data Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins/{{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rina Lestari S.Kom.",
  "access_level": "full"
}

###

### Nonaktifkan Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins/{{adminId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "inactive"
}

###

### Aktifkan Kembali Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins/{{adminId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Suspend Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/admins/{{adminId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "suspended"
}


# =============================================================================
### Super Admin - User Management
# =============================================================================

### Daftar Semua Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Daftar Pengguna dengan Filter Role
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=petani&status=active&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Daftar Pengguna - Pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?q=budi&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Daftar Pengguna - Pembeli Pending
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=pembeli&status=pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detail Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{sampleUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Suspend Pengguna
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{sampleUserId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "suspended",
  "reason": "Pelanggaran kebijakan platform: penipuan identitas."
}

###

### Aktifkan Pengguna
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{sampleUserId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}


# =============================================================================
### Super Admin - Reports
# =============================================================================

### Ringkasan Laporan Platform
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Volume Transaksi Bulanan (Tahun 2025)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/monthly-volume?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Volume Transaksi Bulanan (Tahun berjalan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/monthly-volume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Komoditas Teratas (Top 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/top-commodities?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Komoditas Teratas (Top 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/top-commodities?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ekspor Laporan Transaksi (XLSX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/export?format=xlsx&type=transactions&from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ekspor Laporan Transaksi (CSV)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/export?format=csv&type=transactions&from=2025-04-01&to=2025-04-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ekspor Data Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/export?format=xlsx&type=users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ekspor Laporan Lelang
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/export?format=xlsx&type=auctions&from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Ekspor Laporan Pengaduan
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/export?format=csv&type=complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Super Admin - System Settings
# =============================================================================

### Ambil Semua Pengaturan Sistem
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update Pengaturan Sistem (satu setting)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform_fee_pct": 2.5
}

###

### Update Multiple Pengaturan Sistem
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform_fee_pct": 3.0,
  "maintenance_mode": false,
  "support_email": "support@panenara.id",
  "max_bid_extension_minutes": 15,
  "min_bid_increment_pct": 1.5
}

###

### Aktifkan Maintenance Mode
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maintenance_mode": true
}


# =============================================================================
### Super Admin - Audit Logs
# =============================================================================

### Semua Audit Log (terbaru)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Audit Log dengan Filter Module
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?module=farmer_verification&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Audit Log dengan Pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?q=APPROVE&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Audit Log Module Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit-logs?module=settings&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Admin (Ops) - Dashboard
# =============================================================================

### Dashboard Operasional Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/ops
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Admin (Ops) - Farmer Verifications
# =============================================================================

### Semua Pengajuan Verifikasi (semua status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Verifikasi Menunggu Review
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications?status=waiting&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Verifikasi Perlu Revisi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications?status=needs_revision&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Verifikasi Sudah Disetujui
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications?status=verified&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Verifikasi Ditolak
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications?status=rejected&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detail Pengajuan Verifikasi Petani
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications/{{sampleFarmerVerifId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Setujui Verifikasi Petani
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications/{{sampleFarmerVerifId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Minta Revisi Dokumen Petani
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications/{{sampleFarmerVerifId}}/request-revision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Foto KTP kurang jelas dan tidak terbaca. Harap upload ulang dengan pencahayaan yang cukup dan resolusi minimal 1 MP."
}

###

### Tolak Verifikasi Petani
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/farmer-verifications/{{sampleFarmerVerifId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Dokumen KTP tidak sesuai atau diduga palsu. Verifikasi tidak dapat dilanjutkan."
}


# =============================================================================
### Admin (Ops) - Transactions
# =============================================================================

### Daftar Semua Transaksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Transaksi dengan Filter Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions?status=awaiting_payment&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Transaksi Dispute
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions?status=dispute&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Transaksi dengan Pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions?q=PT+Maju+Bersama&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detail Transaksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/transactions/{{sampleTransactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Admin (Ops) - Auctions
# =============================================================================

### Daftar Semua Lelang
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Lelang Aktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions?status=active&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Lelang Menunggu Pembayaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions?status=awaiting_payment&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Lelang Selesai
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions?status=ended&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Lelang Dibatalkan
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions?status=cancelled&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Lelang dengan Pencarian Komoditas
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions?q=Padi&status=active&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detail Lelang (termasuk riwayat bid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/auctions/{{sampleAuctionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
### Admin (Ops) - Complaints
# =============================================================================

### Daftar Semua Pengaduan
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pengaduan Belum Ditangani
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?status=open&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pengaduan Prioritas Tinggi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?priority=high&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pengaduan Open & Prioritas High
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?status=open&priority=high&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pengaduan Sedang Diproses
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?status=in_progress&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pengaduan Terselesaikan
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?status=resolved&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pengaduan Dieskalasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?status=escalated&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Cari Pengaduan
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints?q=pembayaran&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Detail Pengaduan (beserta balasan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update Status Pengaduan ke In Progress + Assign
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "assigned_to": "{{adminId}}"
}

###

### Naikkan Prioritas Pengaduan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": "high"
}

###

### Eskalasi Pengaduan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "escalated"
}

###

### Selesaikan Pengaduan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved"
}

###

### Balas Pengaduan - Pemberitahuan Awal
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Halo, kami telah menerima laporan Anda dan saat ini sedang menyelidiki masalah pembayaran yang Anda laporkan. Kami akan memberikan update dalam 1x24 jam. Terima kasih atas kesabaran Anda."
}

###

### Balas Pengaduan - Update Progres
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Update: Kami telah berkoordinasi dengan tim keuangan. Proses transfer dana sedang dalam verifikasi dan akan diselesaikan dalam 2 hari kerja."
}

###

### Balas Pengaduan - Penyelesaian
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/complaints/{{sampleComplaintId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Pengaduan Anda telah kami selesaikan. Dana sebesar Rp 7.500.000 telah berhasil ditransfer ke rekening Anda. Mohon konfirmasi jika sudah diterima. Terima kasih telah menggunakan layanan Panenara."
}
